I also need to look at S3 versioning, MFA delete, replication and lifecycle rules, check Route53 for any failover setup or a secondary-region stack with a matching name, and confirm there's no native backup option for Cognito.

"}], "parent_id": "83c419d5-d641-4066-a745-895b0a051969"}

